# Scene 4: The checklist rehearsal. The gate, a week before exam day.
# Agent Fethi at the gate; Si Hédi watching. No vote: the gate inspection
# (content/inspection.json), where admitting the switched-off phone sets phone_admitted.

~ start
Si Hédi: Thirty-one Bacs. Every year someone thinks they've invented a new trick. Every year it's a phone.
Mme Salma: Here's the gate checklist. Let's run the rehearsal.
do Story.show_card(5)
do Story.run_inspection()
